<title>USA: UFP Tech stake raised by Cramer group.</title>
<headline>UFP Tech stake raised by Cramer group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including J.J. Cramer &amp; Co, a New York-based investment firm, said Tuesday it raised its stake in UFP Technologies Inc to 992,900 common shares or 21.4 percent from 20.2 percent previously held.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 60,000 additional shares between September 3 and October 23 at prices ranging from $4.25 to $9 per share.</p>
